WEBVTT

00:06:57.288 --> 00:07:00.458
We also need to address
legal inequality and discrimination.

00:07:00.458 --> 00:07:02.293
Now I feel relatively lucky,

00:07:02.334 --> 00:07:05.337
given the strides being made
in this regard, living in the UK,

00:07:05.337 --> 00:07:09.467
as I'm aware of people around the world,
who are living with HIV,

00:07:09.508 --> 00:07:11.177
that, through discrimination,

00:07:11.218 --> 00:07:14.555
have limitations placed
on what they can and cannot do,

00:07:14.597 --> 00:07:17.558
or even on where they can and cannot live.

00:07:18.976 --> 00:07:22.062
Now, recently, in the UK,
changes have finally been made

00:07:22.104 --> 00:07:24.231
that means that people living with HIV

00:07:24.231 --> 00:07:26.400
can join the armed forces and be deployed,

00:07:26.442 --> 00:07:28.486
or can train as commercial airline pilots.

00:07:28.486 --> 00:07:30.654
Now these changes have only happened